# Personal documents — never track these. Removed 2026-08-17 (was
# client/public/Diego-Damian-Resume.pdf, linked from the navbar and
# #connect); this pattern stops it (or anything like it) from being
# re-added by accident. Note: .gitignore only stops FUTURE commits — the
# original file is still recoverable from git history unless that history
# is separately rewritten.
*[Rr]esume*.pdf

